3. Information Architecture (Adopted from GEMINI)
Structured Chat History: Messages will be clearly attributed (USER:, FLOYD:) and styled differently.
Dedicated Error Zone: Instead of printing errors into the chat, we'll add a hasError flag to our model. If true, a distinct red-bordered error panel appears below the header but above the chat, ensuring it's seen immediately.
Explicit Status Bar: The bottom bar will display key metrics:
🌌 Floyd System: Online
💬 Messages: [count]
❗ Errors: [count] (if any)
4. Interactive Elements
Clear Input: The input line will be visually distinct at the bottom, just above the status bar, with a clear prompt (> ).
Visual Feedback: The cursor will be visible, and the input field will be clearly delineated.

